            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[## What's New

- Fixed Codex internal suggestion and assessment jobs appearing as raw JSON “Task completed” Notch popups.
- Applied provider session visibility filters consistently to both active-session lists and notification cards.

## 中文

- 修复 Codex 内部建议及评估任务以原始 JSON“任务已完成”弹窗出现在 Notch 的问题。
- 会话列表与通知卡片现在统一使用 Provider 提供的会话可见性过滤规则。
]]></description>
